            "text": "/-- `∑_{P₀ ≤ n < M} n^{−s} ≤ (P₀ − 1)^{1−s}/(s − 1)`. -/\ntheorem sum_rpow_neg_le {s : ℝ} (hs : 1 < s) {P0 : ℕ} (hP0 : 2 ≤ P0) (M : ℕ) :\n    ∑ n ∈ Ico P0 M, (n : ℝ) ^ (-s) ≤ ((P0 : ℝ) - 1) ^ (1 - s) / (s - 1) := by",
